*> vybe-test: cobol/move_group_redefines/redefines_numeric_group_parts
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_move_group_redefines.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 DATE-FIELD PIC X(8) VALUE "20231225".
01 DATE-PARTS REDEFINES DATE-FIELD.
   05 DP-YEAR PIC 9(4).
   05 DP-MONTH PIC 9(2).
   05 DP-DAY PIC 9(2).
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    DISPLAY DP-YEAR.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING DP-YEAR DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "2023"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [2023] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY DP-MONTH.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING DP-MONTH DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "12"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [12] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY DP-DAY.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING DP-DAY DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "25"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [25] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

